    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/22/Lost_Worlds_Logo.png/revision/latest?cb=20140120122117\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Lost Worlds logo as appeared on compatible game books.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/22/Lost_Worlds_Logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20140120122117\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"104\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Lost Worlds Logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Lost_Worlds_Logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Lost_Worlds_Logo.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">兼容游戏书上出现的失落世界标志。</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p><b>失落的世界</b>  是战斗图画书系列的名称，也指其使用的系统，由  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://firelightgames.com/alfred-leonardi-game-designer/\">阿尔弗雷德·莱昂纳迪。</a>失落世界是一本战斗游戏书，以奇幻生物和元素战斗为特色。其魅力在于无需骰子即可游玩，只需两到四本书。这些书在美国的当前分销商是火光游戏公司和 <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.flyingbuffalo.com/lostw.shtml\">飞牛公司。</a>\n</p><p>HobbyJapan授权失落世界系统用于女皇之刃系列(其中一些  <a href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Blade_Combat_Books\" title=\"Queen&#39;s Blade Combat Books\">女皇之刃</a>  角色基于已创造的失落世界对应角色)\n\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">内容</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">历史</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#How_to_Play\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">玩法介绍</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Link_with_Queen&#39;s_Blade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">与女皇之刃联动</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_Links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">外部链接</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">历史</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLost_Worlds%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>完整历史，参见维基百科文章  <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lost_Worlds_(gamebook)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Lost Worlds (gamebook)\">这里</a>.</i>\n</p><p>第一批失落世界战斗书由莱昂纳迪于1983年为诺瓦游戏设计公司创作——在他其他设计游戏书成功两年后，如 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ace_of_Aces_(picture_book_game)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Ace of Aces (picture book game)\">王牌对王牌。</a>此后，在90年代末，各公司创作了75款游戏，如灰海和飞牛，从原创角色到授权角色。失落世界系统以其无骰子移动矩阵系统闻名，也被其他公司使用，特别是战斗书和游戏车间。\n\n</p><p>该系列的当前所有者是吉尔·莱昂纳迪，阿尔弗雷德·莱昂纳迪的女儿，也是一位游戏设计师，她还设计新矩阵用于女皇之刃，以及新品牌「传奇护手」，由其新公司  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://firelightgames.com\">火光游戏公司</a>旧书的当前分销商是飞牛公司，该公司也将自己专营的《隧道与巨魔》中的一些角色加入了失落世界。\n\n</p><p>如今，该系统广为人知，因其被用于2005年开始的女皇之刃系列。\n\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_Play\">玩法介绍</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLost_Worlds%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>参见  <a href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Blade_Combat_Books#How_to_Play\" title=\"Queen&#39;s Blade Combat Books\">玩法介绍</a>  详情参见《女皇之刃战斗书》文章。</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Link_with_Queen.27s_Blade\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Link_with_Queen's_Blade\">与女皇之刃联动</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLost_Worlds%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/9a/Leina_GB.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130630053316\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The combat book featuring  with the Lost Worlds logo in the bottom.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/9a/Leina_GB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130630053316\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"256\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Leina GB.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Leina_GB.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Leina_GB.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">战斗书以  <a href=\"/wiki/Leina_Vance\" title=\"Leina Vance\">蕾娜</a>  底部有失落世界标志。</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>除了失落世界系统用于女皇之刃游戏书外，女皇之刃中一些角色的矩阵和动作集使用了失落世界角色的矩阵，但少数角色除外，因为失落世界的对应角色不具备这些能力。\n\n</p><p>部分角色有相互关联的相似性(如蕾娜和穿锁甲的男人)，而其他角色则直接使用了他们的属性模板，因为他们的招式与《女皇之刃》角色设计目标相似(如来自《餐桌骑士LW》游戏书的妮柯斯和特夫隆·比利)。像梅罗娜这样的角色是新角色，拥有新的属性值和动作组，这些并未在《失落世界》系列中使用(例如梅罗娜的「变形」能力)。\n\n</p><p>由于它们与《失落世界》兼容(封面已注明)，它们可以与其他《失落世界》书籍一起使用，但新角色可能存在兼容性问题。\n\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 218px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4c/5324047020110211160604062_640.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150930140709\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"5324047020110211160604062 640\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4c/5324047020110211160604062_640.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/218?cb=20150930140709\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"218\" height=\"116\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"5324047020110211160604062 640.jpg\" data-image-key=\"5324047020110211160604062_640.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:5324047020110211160604062_640.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 274px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4d/5324047020110211163902022_640.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150930140701\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"5324047020110211163902022 640\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"274\" height=\"145\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"5324047020110211163902022 640.jpg\" data-image-key=\"5324047020110211163902022_640.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4d/5324047020110211163902022_640.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/274?cb=20150930140701\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4d/5324047020110211163902022_640.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150930140701\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"5324047020110211163902022 640\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4d/5324047020110211163902022_640.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/274?cb=20150930140701\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"274\" height=\"145\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"5324047020110211163902022 640.jpg\" data-image-key=\"5324047020110211163902022_640.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4d/5324047020110211163902022_640.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/274?cb=20150930140701\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:5324047020110211163902022_640.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 264px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/52/5324047020110211161309057_640.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150930140718\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"5324047020110211161309057 640\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"264\" height=\"141\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"5324047020110211161309057 640.jpg\" data-image-key=\"5324047020110211161309057_640.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/52/5324047020110211161309057_640.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/264?cb=20150930140718\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/52/5324047020110211161309057_640.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150930140718\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"5324047020110211161309057 640\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/52/5324047020110211161309057_640.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/264?cb=20150930140718\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"264\" height=\"141\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"5324047020110211161309057 640.jpg\" data-image-key=\"5324047020110211161309057_640.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/52/5324047020110211161309057_640.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/264?cb=20150930140718\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:5324047020110211161309057_640.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_Links\">外部链接</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-b